# What a Vercel deployment must NOT upload.
#
# Vercel's build runs `npm run build`, which executes scripts/gen-*.cjs and
# writes docs/BLOCKS.md — so scripts/ and docs/ must be uploaded. Until
# 2026-09-14 both were excluded here, which would have failed every build.
# Nothing noticed because AEON has never been deployed to Vercel (zero
# deployments on the account since this repository was created).

# ── Build output & dependencies (Vercel installs and builds itself) ──
node_modules
.git
dist

# ── Secrets and personal data — nothing personal rides to the cloud ──
.env
.env.*
secrets/
db/
Data/
data/
vault
Vault
src/blocks/*/data/
Inbox
tmp/
logs/

# ── Local-only runtime files ─────────────────────────────────
chat_log.json
audit_log.json
aeon_notes.json
aeon_terminal_history.json
token_ledger.json

# ── Desktop-only launchers ───────────────────────────────────
*.bat
*.command
launch.sh

# ── Not needed to build or serve ─────────────────────────────
tests/
.claude/
.github/
archive/
Half-Baked/
*.bak-*
